		{
			dependencies: ["5BB9CDDB5CC625A3"]
			description: [
				"你走进一个村庄，本该更热闹，却显得异常寂静。 &e仿佛刚刚发生过可怕的事情。 &r尽管屋顶和遮阳篷色彩鲜艳，空气中却弥漫着一种令人不安和绝望的气息。其中一个村民看到你进来，便朝你招手示意。"
				""
				"&b\"You must be new around here. I can see the confusion on your face. My name is &6Derrick&b. Normally it would be much happier around here, but our village has sustained several attacks recently. &6Death Worms&b reside in the desert around us. &eEach night they have ransacked the village, killed our livestock, and destroyed our buildings.&b We are struggling to rebuild.\""
				""
				"&b“嘿！我刚刚想到一件事。你看起来像是个建筑高手。能帮我们提供一些物资来加固防御吗？&5如果没有办法挡住&6死亡蠕虫&5，我们将永远无法恢复。&b 怎么样？如果你帮我们重建，我甚至可以付报酬给你。”"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "supplementaries:bamboo_spikes_tipped"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					Potion: "minecraft:poison"
				}
